Acceptance criteria:
- The inner raised surround follows the bowed screen sides and corners.
- Sampled visible native CRT edge pixels remain inside the display geometry.
- Shortest distance from sampled image edges to the display outline is under
  nine native pixels; this is a fitted outline, not an arbitrary-shader guarantee.
- Display UVs retain the existing framebuffer coordinates without another warp.
- Unfiltered rectangular corners remain visible; switching back restores curves.
- Geometry changes do not replace the game runtime, material, texture or saves.
- The outer charcoal bezel and existing power/lighting behavior remain intact.

